# Corpus: file redirects in several shapes — `> /dev/null`, a redirect ahead of
# the command (`2>&1 whoami`), and `>&2`. Four Redirect nodes across the four
# command lines, none recovered into an ERROR.
<<<cmd
"$TP" run std.shell --input test/suite/shellfamily/inputs/commands__7.sh --dump-tree
<<<assert
exit 0
out-absent ERROR
out-absent MISSING
out-count 4 Redirect [
